+| H-2 | High | `PriceOracle` config | wstETH collateral priced off the **stETH**/USD feed |
+| H-3 | High | `LendingMarket._borrow` / `liquidateAll` | `borrowers` array grows without bound → liquidation sweep bricked |
+| H-4 | High | all ERC-20 call sites | Return values unchecked — silently breaks USDT (on the shortlist) |
